  "title": "Bridge contract paths across Shared and Stage ownership",
  "goal": "Let the previous trusted base validate the legacy and final CP11p contract layouts without ambiguity or silent fallback.",
  "acceptanceCriteria": [
    "IFX-only contract consumers resolve exactly one legacy or owned Shared, Diff or CI schema.",
