    "Policy candidate validation discovers registered schemas in either layout from explicit Git objects.",
    "Existing manifest, CI, deployment and trusted-base tests pass in the legacy layout.",
    "Trusted Diff and trusted-component candidate validation pass with exact authorization consumption."
